"holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":6,"title":"Young girl pointing","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":7,"title":"Empty page with bananas","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":8,"title":"Busy Indian fruit market with people and vendors","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":9,"title":"Young angry girl folding hands","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":10,"title":"Empty page with flowers","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":11,"title":"Busy Indian flower market with people and vendors","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":12,"title":"Girl holding bag full of flowers","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":13,"title":"Empty page with clothes hanging","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":14,"title":"Busy Indian market with people and vendors selling clothes","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":15,"title":"Girl with thumbs up","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":16,"title":"Empty page with cats and crabs","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":17,"title":"Busy Indian meat market with people and vendors","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":18,"title":"Girl holding her mother's hand","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":19,"title":"Empty page with a teapot and glass","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":20,"title":"Girl hiding, Mother cooking in the kitchen","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":21,"title":"Tired girl walking","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":22,"title":"Girl eating dinner","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":23,"title":"Busy Indian vegetable market","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":24,"title":"Busy Indian fruit market","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":25,"title":"Busy Indian flower market","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":26,"title":"Busy Indian market clty","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":27,"title":"Busy Indian meat market","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":28,"title":"Mother cooking in the kitchen and Girl hiding","illustrator":"Jemma Jose","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾನು ಮಿಯಾ.","ಅಮ್ಮನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಸಂತೆಗೆ ಹೊರಟಿರುವೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಕಣ್ಣಾಮುಚ್ಚಾಲೆ ಆಟದಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನ ಮೀರಿಸುವವರೇ ಇಲ್ಲ!","ಸಂತೆಯಲ್ಲೂ ನೀವು ನನ್ನ ಹುಡುಕಲಾರಿರಿ… ಕೂ… ಅಮ್ಮನ ಅಂಗಡಿ ಪಟ್ಟಿ ಪತ್ತೆ ಮಾಡುವೆ, ನಿಮಗಿಂತ ಮೊದಲೇ!"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಂಗಡಿ ಪಟ್ಟಿ","(1) ಹತ್ತು ಕೆಂಪು ಮೆಣಸು","(2) ಎರಡು ಹಸಿರು ಟೊಮೆಟೊ","(3) ಒಂದು ಆಲೂಗಡ್ಡೆ","(4) ಒಂದು ಡುಮ್ಮ ಸಿಹಿಕುಂಬಳ"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಯ್ಯಯ್ಯೋ!","ನನ್ನ ಹುಡುಕಿಯೇ ಬಿಟ್ಟಿರಾ?"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹುಡುಕು:","(1) ಆರು ಹಳದಿ ಬಾಳೆಹಣ್ಣು","(2) ಮೂರು ಕಿತ್ತಳೆ ಹಣ್ಣು","(3) ಒಂದು ಕೆಂಪು ಸೇಬು","(4) ಕಾಂಡ ಸಹಿತ ಒಂದು ಹಸಿರು ಪಪ್ಪಾಯ"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಏನು ಅಮ್ಮನ ಪಟ್ಟಿಯಲ್ಲಿನ ಹಣ್ಣುಗಳ ಹೆಸರು ಮತ್ತು ನನ್ನನ್ನೂ ಪತ್ತೆ ಹಚ್ಚಿದಿರಾ?","ಮತ್ತೆ ಹೀಗಾಗಲ್ಲ ಬಿಡಿ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹುಡುಕು:","(1) ಐದು ಗುಲಾಬಿ","(2) ನೇರಳೆ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಹೂ ಮಾಲೆ","(3) ಮಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಮೊಗ್ಗು","(4) ಹೂ ಹೂವಿನ ಚಡ್ಡಿ"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲ, ಇಲ್ಲ… ಇದು ಸರಿಯಲ್ಲ!","ಬಚ್ಚಿಟ್ಟುಕೊಳ್ಳುವುದರಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನ ಮೀರಿಸುವವರೇ ಇಲ್ಲ!"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹುಡುಕಿ:","(1) ಚುಕ್ಕಿ ಚುಕ್ಕಿಗಳ ಲುಂಗಿ","(2) ಹಸಿರು ಪಟ್ಟೆಗಳ ಸೀರೆ","(3) ಚೌಕಳಿ ಚಿತ್ರದ ಸಮವಸ್ತ್ರ","(4) ಕಪ್ಪು ಬಣ್ಣದ ಸಾದಾ ಟೀ ಶರ್ಟ್"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನಾನು ಬಚ್ಚಿಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡಿದ್ದ ಜಾಗವನ್ನು ಅಮ್ಮನೇ ತೋರಿಸಿರಬೇಕು?","ನೋಡೋಣ, ಈಗ ಹೇಗೆ ಹುಡುಕುತ್ತೀರಿ... ಕೂ…"]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹುಡುಕಿ:","(1) ಮೂರು ಕಚ್ಚುವ ಏಡಿಗಳು","(2) ಒಂದು ಕುಣಿಯುವ ಬಂಡಾಸೆ (ಸ್ಕ್ವಿಡ್)","(3) ಏಳು ಸೀಗಡಿ","(4) ಐಸ್ ಮೇಲೆ ಮಲಗಿರುವ ಎರಡು ಮೀನು","(ಸ್ಕ್ವಿಡ್ - ಹತ್ತು ತೋಳುಗಳುಳ್ಳ ನೀಳಕಾಯದ ಒಂದು ಸಮುದ್ರಜೀವಿ )"]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಈಗಲೂ ಪತ್ತೆ ಮಾಡಿಬಿಟ್ಟಿರಾ?","ಆದರೆ, ನಮ್ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲೇ ನನ್ನ ಹುಡುಕಿ ಬಿಡಿ ನೋಡೋಣ..! ಅದಂತೂ ಅಸಾಧ್ಯ..!"]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹುಡುಕಿ ನೋಡೋಣ…","(1) ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮಡಕೆ","(2) ಮರದ ಸೌಟು","(3) ಬೆಂಕಿಪೊಟ್ಟಣ","(4) ನೀರಿನ ಬಾಟಲಿ"]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p19.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಈಗಲೂ ನಾನು ಕಂಡುಬಿಟ್ಟೆನಾ?","“ಹೋಗಲಿ ಬಿಡಿ... ನನಗೀಗ ಗಬಗಬ","ಊಟ ಮಾಡುವಷ್ಟು ಹಸಿವಾಗಿದೆ,”","ಆಟ ಸಾಕು."]},{"n":21,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p21.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಅಮ್ಮ ಆಟ ಸಾಕು ಎನ್ನದೇ ಇದ್ದಿದ್ದರೆ, ನಾನು ಖಂಡಿತ ಗೆಲ್ಲುತ್ತಿದ್ದೆ.","‘ಕಣ್ಣಾಮುಚ್ಚಾಲೆ ಆಟದಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನ ಮೀರಿಸುವವರು ಯಾರೂ ಇಲ್ಲ!' ಗೊತ್ತಾ?"]},{"n":22,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p22.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಹತ್ತು ಕೆಂಪು ಮೆಣಸಿನಕಾಯಿ (2) ಎರಡು ಹಸಿರು ಟೊಮೆಟೊಗಳು (3) ಒಂದು ಆಲೂಗಡ್ಡೆ (4) ಒಂದು ಡುಮ್ಮ ಸಿಹಿಕುಂಬಳ"]},{"n":23,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p23.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಹಳದಿ ಬಾಳೆಹಣ್ಣುಗಳು 6 (2) ಕಿತ್ತಳೆ ಹಣ್ಣು 3","(3) ಒಂದು ಕೆಂಪು ಸೇಬು (4) ಕಾಂಡವಿರುವ ಒಂದು ಹಸಿರು ಪಪ್ಪಾಯ"]},{"n":24,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p24.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಗುಲಾಬಿಗಳು ಐದು (2) ಒಂದು ನೇರಳೆ ಹೂವಿನ ಮಾಲೆ","(3) ಮಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಮೊಗ್ಗು (4) ಬಣ್ಣ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಚೆಡ್ಡಿ"]},{"n":25,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p25.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಚುಕ್ಕಿ ಚುಕ್ಕಿಗಳ ಲುಂಗಿ (2) ಹಸಿರು ಪಟ್ಟೆಗಳುಳ್ಳ ಸೀರೆ","(3) ಒಂದು ಶಾಲೆ ಸಮವಸ್ತ್ರ (4) ಚೌಕಳಿ ಚಿತ್ರದ ಸಮವಸ್ತ್ರ","(5) ಕಪ್ಪು ಬಣ್ಣದ ಸಾದಾ ಮೇಲುಡುಪು"]},{"n":26,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p26.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಮೂರು ಕಚ್ಚುವ ಏಡಿಗಳು (2) ಒಂದು ಕುಣಿಯುವ ಬಂಡಾಸೆ (ಸ್ಕ್ವಿಡ್)","(3) ಏಳು ಸೀಗಡಿ (4) ಐಸ್ ಮೇಲಿಟ್ಟಿರುವ ಎರಡು ಮೀನು"]},{"n":27,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/24791-kannamucche-kaadee-goode/p27.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["(1) ಒಂದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮಡಕೆ (2) ಮರದ ಸೌಟು","(3) ಬೆಂಕಿಪೊಟ್ಟಣ (4) ನೀರಿನ ಬಾಟಲಿ"]}],"wordCount":302}